  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADD West Africa - Advancing alcohol policies for sustainable development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADD West Africa programme will contribute to a lower level of alcohol-related harm in selected countries in the region, especially related to alcohol-related diseases, mental health disorders, gender-based violence and road accidents. The project will build capacity of national alcohol policy alliances which will contribute towards development, adoption and approval of National Alcohol Policies at country level. WAAPA will collaborate with its seven in-country alliances in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
